{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000737","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000737"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000737","label":"陰陵田父","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"一田父","mention_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0077"]},{"surface":"田父","mention_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0081"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0077","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p041","quote":"一田父"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0081","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p041","quote":"田父"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0077","c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0081"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p041"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-007-xiangyu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0077","start":77,"end":80,"surface":"一田父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000737","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p041","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"田父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000737","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p041","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p041","text":"於是項王乃上馬騎，麾下壯士騎從者八百餘人，直夜潰圍南出，馳走。平明，漢軍乃覺之，令騎將灌嬰以五千騎追之。項王渡淮，騎能屬者百餘人耳。項王至陰陵，迷失道，問一田父，田父紿曰「左」。左，乃陷大澤中。以故漢追及之。項王乃復引兵而東，至東城，乃有二十八騎。漢騎追者數千人。項王自度不得脫。謂其騎曰：「吾起兵至今八歲矣，身七十餘戰，所當者破，所擊者服，未嘗敗北，遂霸有天下。然今卒困於此，此天之亡我，非戰之罪也。今日固決死，願為諸君快戰，必三勝之，為諸君潰圍，斬將，刈旗，令諸君知天亡我，非戰之罪也。」乃分其騎以為四隊，四嚮。漢軍圍之數重。項王謂其騎曰：「吾為公取彼一將。」令四面騎馳下，期山東為三處。於是項王大呼馳下，漢軍皆披靡，遂斬漢一將。是時，赤泉侯為騎將，追項王，項王瞋目而叱之，赤泉侯人馬俱驚，辟易數里與其騎會為三處。漢軍不知項王所在，乃分軍為三，復圍之。項王乃馳，復斬漢一都尉，殺數十百人，復聚其騎，亡其兩騎耳。乃謂其騎曰：「何如？」騎皆伏曰：「如大王言。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0016","start":16,"end":20,"surface":"八百餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"灌嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000729","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0077","start":77,"end":80,"surface":"一田父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000737","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"田父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000737","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0119","start":119,"end":123,"surface":"二十八騎","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m041-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_pro